{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Depopulation Agent</strong> is an action-packed, arcade style, active shooter simulation with sandbox elements. Play as a lone terrorist with the sole mission of reducing the human population by <i>any means necessary</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exterminate humans to earn points, to unlock new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast-paced combat with law enforcement and anti-terror personnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take cash from slain civilians to buy weapons and gear from the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom loadouts to carry out your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple levels with varying degrees of difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Content displayed is subject to change as this project is in development.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547730?t=1744573116","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547730?t=1744573116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/c74913a7d889834f261f695b64b64d801e63a88d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744573116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/c74913a7d889834f261f695b64b64d801e63a88d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744573116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of violence including blood, gore, and acts of terrorism"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Depopulation Agent</strong> is an action-pac